              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok ka wat a dano moro ame waŋo kome, obino pi kwanyo cogo i ot, ee openyo dano ame tye i gul ot ni, “Dano moro pwod odoŋ bani?” en bi no kwero oko ni, “Pe gire”; dok bi no kobo ni, “Liŋ, Mom myero otuc nyiŋ Rwot.”",
